data.body:
@AgentOak I can understand your frustration but this bot really helps the dev team. There are currently more than 1.8k open issues. Having a bot pinging the reporter of old issues to check if the issue is still relevant allows the bot to close outdated ones and promote the issues that are still to be fixed, implemented or discussed during triage.

There is no hidden agenda to spam users with notifications or hide the issues to discourage them contributing. The contribution from the community is really precious.

See [this comment](https://github.com/mozilla-mobile/fenix/issues/13946#issuecomment-891659003) for more context.
